TI  - Wheelchair-modified ergometer rowing exercise in individuals with spinal cord injury: a feasibility, acceptability, and preliminary efficacy study
T2  - SPINAL CORD SERIES AND CASES
LA  - English
KW  - SHOULDER PAIN
KW  - PHYSICAL-ACTIVITY
KW  - ELECTRICAL-STIMULATION
