TI  - Effects of 16 weeks of pyramidal and polarized training intensity distributions in well-trained endurance runners
T2  - SCANDINAVIAN JOURNAL OF MEDICINE & SCIENCE IN SPORTS
LA  - English
KW  - polarized training
KW  - pyramidal training
KW  - running performance
KW  - training intensity distribution
