TI  - Greater Goal Difference is Associated with Lower Physical Demands in Cerebral Palsy Football Referees
T2  - MONTENEGRIN JOURNAL OF SPORTS SCIENCE AND MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - soccer
KW  - contextual factors
KW  - performance
