TI  - Modeling heart rate (HR) dynamics to reconstruct missing HR data in trail running
T2  - BMC SPORTS SCIENCE MEDICINE AND REHABILITATION
LA  - English
KW  - Heart rate
KW  - Missing data
KW  - Reconstruction
KW  - Running
KW  - Trail
