TI  - PHYSIOLOGICAL CHARACTERISTICS AND RESERVES OF THE CARDIOVASCULAR SYSTEM IN PROFESSIONAL FEMALE ATHLETES DURING THE PRE-INVOLUTION PERIOD
T2  - HUMAN SPORT MEDICINE
