TI  - Effects of Mindfulness-Acceptance-Insight-Commitment (MAIC) Training on Stress and Sleep Quality in Elite Swimmers: A Randomized Controlled Mixed-Methods Trial
T2  - BEHAVIORAL SCIENCES
LA  - English
KW  - mindfulness
KW  - MAIC
KW  - elite swimmers
