TI  - The impact of fatigue and different environmental conditions on heart rate responses and shooting accuracy during laser run event in elite modern pentathletes
T2  - BMC SPORTS SCIENCE MEDICINE AND REHABILITATION
LA  - English
KW  - Modern pentathlon
