TI  - Higher final speed in 30-15 intermittent fitness tests correlates with soccer's locomotor demands, not heart rate responses in small-sided soccer games
T2  - SCIENTIFIC REPORTS
LA  - English
KW  - Football
KW  - Athletic performance
KW  - Training load
KW  - Conditioned games
KW  - Drill-based games
KW  - PHYSIOLOGICAL-RESPONSES
KW  - RELIABILITY
KW  - PERFORMANCE
