TI  - Impact of Ramadan intermittent fasting on cognitive function in trained cyclists: a pilot study
T2  - BIOLOGY OF SPORT
LA  - English
KW  - riders
KW  - fasters
KW  - intermittent fasting
KW  - PERFORMANCE
