TI  - Training experience and weekly training total time vs. aerobic capacity and level of effective restitution of male Polish Judo National Senior Team athletes during the preparation period for the Olympic Games
T2  - ARCHIVES OF BUDO SCIENCE OF MARTIAL ARTS AND EXTREME SPORTS
