TI  - Submaximal Fitness Tests in Team Sports: A Theoretical Framework for Evaluating Physiological State
T2  - SPORTS MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - INTERMITTENT RECOVERY TEST
KW  - TEST LEVEL 1
KW  - HEART-RATE RESPONSES
KW  - 2-WEEK SOCCER CAMP
KW  - SMALL-SIDED GAMES
