TI  - Effect of a lactate-guided conditioning program on heart rate variability obtained using 24-Holter electrocardiography in Beagle dogs
T2  - PLOS ONE
LA  - English
KW  - MITRAL-VALVE DISEASE
KW  - ENDURANCE EXERCISE
KW  - TRAINING ADAPTATION
KW  - PARAMETERS
