TI  - Effect of 4 Weeks of High-Intensity Interval Training (HIIT) on VO2max, Anaerobic Power, and Specific Performance in Cyclists with Cerebral Palsy
T2  - JOURNAL OF FUNCTIONAL MORPHOLOGY AND KINESIOLOGY
LA  - English
