TI  - Effects of Synchronizing Foot Strike and Cardiac Phase on Exercise Hemodynamics in Patients With Cardiac Resynchronization Therapy: A Within-Subjects Pilot Study to Fine-Tune Cardio-Locomotor Coupling for Heart Failure
T2  - CIRCULATION
LA  - English
KW  - cardiac resynchronization therapy
KW  - exercise
