TI  - Exercise and Bone Mass in Adults
T2  - SPORTS MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - HIGH-IMPACT EXERCISE
KW  - RANDOMIZED CONTROLLED-TRIAL
KW  - SITE-SPECIFIC RESPONSE
