TI  - Application of Global Positioning System and Microsensor Technology in Competitive Rugby League Match-Play: A Systematic Review and Meta-analysis
T2  - SPORTS MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - PHYSICAL DEMANDS
KW  - MOVEMENT PATTERNS
KW  - ACTIVITY PROFILES
KW  - METABOLIC POWER
