TI  - Perspectives on Concurrent Strength and Endurance Training in Healthy Adult Females: A Systematic Review
T2  - SPORTS MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - LOW-BACK-PAIN
KW  - RHEUMATOID-ARTHRITIS METAANALYSIS
KW  - RELATIVE ENERGY DEFICIENCY
