TI  - Frequency of various kinds of behaviour and emotional excitability in Thoroughbred yearlings trained by natural methods
T2  - MEDYCYNA WETERYNARYJNA-VETERINARY MEDICINE-SCIENCE AND PRACTICE
LA  - Polish
KW  - horse
KW  - heart rhythm
