TI  - TIME-VARIANT POWER SPECTRUM ANALYSIS FOR THE DETECTION OF TRANSIENT EPISODES IN HRV SIGNAL
T2  - IEEE TRANSACTIONS ON BIOMEDICAL ENGINEERING
LA  - English
KW  - HEART-RATE-VARIABILITY
