TI  - Is a threshold-based model a superior method to the relative percent concept for establishing individual exercise intensity? a randomized controlled trial
T2  - BMC SPORTS SCIENCE MEDICINE AND REHABILITATION
LA  - English
KW  - Cardiorespiratory fitness
