TI  - Cardiovascular autonomic response to food ingestion in patients with gastritis: A comparison between Helicobacter pylori-positive and -negative patients
T2  - HELICOBACTER
LA  - English
KW  - Helicobacter pylori
KW  - autonomic dysfunction
KW  - cardiovascular
