TI  - Acute effects of aerobic versus anaerobic running on heart rate variability and autonomic nervous system indices in male college athletes: a within-subject comparison
T2  - FRONTIERS IN PHYSIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - aerobic and anaerobic exercise
KW  - autonomic nervous system
KW  - college athletes
