TI  - Serum cardiac markers are inversely associated with VO2max of amateur athletes in response to endurance training adaptations
T2  - BMJ OPEN SPORT & EXERCISE MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - TROPONIN-T RELEASE
KW  - MUSCLE DAMAGE
