TI  - Low-fat diet, and medium-fat diets containing coconut oil and soybean oil exert different metabolic effects in untrained and treadmill-trained mice
T2  - JOURNAL OF THE INTERNATIONAL SOCIETY OF SPORTS NUTRITION
LA  - English
KW  - Low-fat diet
KW  - Soybean oil
KW  - Coconut oil
